   "note": "The amendment's CAMB 147.1027 and CLASS 147.0971 anchors are reproduced at the Planck 2018 Table 2 TT,TE,EE+lowE+lensing marginalised means with N_eff = 3.044 and one massive 0.06 eV neutrino (reproduction first reported by the referee, re-run here). They are point evaluations at the posterior means, so they are not expected to equal the posterior mean 147.09 exactly. The CLASS 147.0971 value needs N_ur = 2.0328, for which CLASS itself reports N_eff = 3.046, not 3.044; with N_ur = 2.0308 (CLASS N_eff = 3.044, the setting used in rd_camb_table.py) CLASS gives 147.1071, i.e. +3e-5 fractional from CAMB at matched N_eff."
